<title>UK: HORSE RACING-REAMS OF VERSE WINS EPSOM OAKS.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-REAMS OF VERSE WINS EPSOM OAKS.</headline>
<dateline>EPSOM, England 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reams of Verse, ridden by Kieren Fallon, won the Epsom Oaks horse racing classic on Friday.</p>
